    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly brings to the market this beautiful three bedroom duplex apartment situated in the hugely popular Maryborough Woods development in Douglas. \r\n\r\nThe property is in impeccable condition throughout having been superbly maintained and cared for by its present owner. Once you walk-in, it has a nice welcoming hall with cloak area into a large open plan kitchen/dining/living area that has access onto a hugely impressive balcony area. It has three spacious bedrooms (1 en-suite ) & main bathroom, consisting in total of 1,175 sq ft. The property has extremely well cared for common areas and overlooks a mature green area to the front & rear.\r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located, within walking distance to all the amenities and services in Douglas and is just a short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. It has a regular 24 hour public bus service available at its doorstep as well as having easy access onto the South Link road network.\r\n\r\nViewing of this turn key apartment in a superb location comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.42m x 1.94m \r\nTeak hardwood front door with glazing, wooden floor, centre light, under stair storage, double doors to living room, carpet stairway. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.72m x 1.26m \r\nTile floor, WC, WHB with wall mirror and tile surround, centre light. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.85m x 3.53m \r\nWooden/tile flooring, double doors to balcony area, centre/recessed lighting, extensive fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, gas hob, overhead extractor unit, integrated dishwasher, fridge/freezer. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.42m x 3.75m \r\nWooden floor, bay window, double doors to kitchen/dining, double doors to entrance hall, gas fireplace with wooden mantle, TV point. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - 3.46m x 1.92m \r\nCarpet floor, hot press unit with shelving, centre light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.76m x 3.72m \r\nCentre light, large built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 1.92m x 2.67m \r\nTile floor, large wall mirror, WC, WHB with tile surround, electric shower unit with enclosure, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 3.16m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, large built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.16m x 2.37m \r\nWooden floor, centre light. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.87m x 2.21m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, bath unit with overhead shower, WC, WHB, Velux window, wall mirrors. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 109.2 sq metres  (1,175 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows\r\nSpacious living accommodation with large balcony area\r\nDesignated Parking\r\nOverlooking green area to the front & rear\r\nQuiet cul de sac position\r\nImmaculate condition throughout\r\nReady for immediate occupation \r\nMinutes to all amenities & services in Douglas\r\nEasy access to South Link road network\r\nRegular access to public bus service available at doorstep\r\nShort drive to Cork Airport, Cork City Centre & Ringaskiddy"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Douglas, at the Fingerpost roundabout, take the exit for Maryborough Hill. At the traffic lights outside Maryborough Hotel, turn right into Maryborough Woods. Continue straight through the main thoroughfare of Maryborough Woods passing Maryborough Mall. Take the left hand turn signposted for Welwyn Road/Highfields. Continue along this road and take the next right with No.69 situated on the left handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode: T12 DW71"
      }
